title: Rock Song in A
key: A
tempo: 120
style: rock

// An intro, a verse, a chorus that opens on the four, a bridge on the minor six
// that turns round on the five of five, and an outro that comes home.
[Intro]
| A | % | D | A |

[Verse]
| A | % | D | A |
| A | % | E | E |

[Chorus]
| D | E | A | F#m |
| D | E | A | A   |

[Verse]

[Chorus]

[Bridge]
| F#m | D | A | A |
| F#m | D | B | E |

[Chorus]

[Outro]
| D | A | E D | A |

